{{define "subject"}}{{with .Reissue}}Teie uued piletid — {{$.EventName}}{{else}}{{if gt (len .Tickets) 1}}Teie piletid — {{.EventName}}{{else}}Teie pilet — {{.EventName}}{{end}}{{end}}{{end}}

{{define "html"}}<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="et" dir="ltr">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Teie pilet</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f2f4f5;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f2f4f5;padding:24px 0;"><tr><td align="center">
<table role="presentation" width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:560px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
  {{with .Branding.LogoURL}}<tr><td align="center" style="background:#ffffff;padding:18px 32px 12px 32px;"><img src="{{.}}" width="160" alt="{{$.Branding.LogoAlt}}" style="display:block;width:160px;height:auto;border:0;"></td></tr>{{else}}<tr><td align="center" style="background:#ffffff;padding:20px 32px 10px 32px;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;color:#22333D;">{{.Branding.OrgName}}</td></tr>{{end}}
  <tr><td style="background:{{.Accent}};height:3px;font-size:1px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:28px 32px 8px 32px;color:#22333D;font-size:16px;">Tere{{with .HolderName}} {{.}}{{end}}!</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:8px 32px;color:#46555f;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">{{with .Reissue}}{{if .Typo}}Ostul antud e-posti aadressis oli kirjaviga, mistõttu jõudis esimene piletitega kiri teisele aadressile. Võtsite korraldajaga ühendust ja kinnitasite oma andmed. Oleme teile väljastanud uued piletid, need on lisatud.<br><br>Esimese kirja piletid ei kehti enam. Sissepääsuks kehtivad ainult uued piletid.{{else}}Teie soovil oleme varasemate piletite asemel väljastanud uued piletid. Need on lisatud.<br><br>Varasemad piletid ei kehti enam. Sissepääsuks kehtivad ainult uued piletid.{{end}}<br><br>Teie kohad ja makse ei ole muutunud.{{with .OrderNumber}} Tellimuse number: {{.}}.{{end}}{{else}}{{if gt (len .Tickets) 1}}Täname ostu eest. Teie piletid ürituse „{{.EventName}}“ jaoks on selle e-kirja lisatud (PDF-failid).{{else}}Täname ostu eest. Teie pilet ürituse „{{.EventName}}“ jaoks on selle e-kirja lisatud (PDF).{{end}}{{end}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:8px 32px;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-left:4px solid {{.Accent}};background:#f8f9fa;"><tr><td style="padding:12px 16px;color:#22333D;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">
      <strong>{{.EventName}}</strong>{{with .SessionStart}}<br>{{.}}{{end}}{{with .DoorsOpen}}<br>Uksed avatakse {{.}}{{end}}{{with .VenueName}}<br>{{.}}{{end}}{{with .Directions.GoogleURL}}<br>Teekond: <a href="{{.}}" style="color:{{$.Accent}};">Google Maps</a> · <a href="{{$.Directions.WazeURL}}" style="color:{{$.Accent}};">Waze</a>{{end}}
    </td></tr></table>
  </td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:8px 32px;">
    <div style="font-size:12px;color:#93a0a8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;padding-bottom:4px;">{{if gt (len .Tickets) 1}}Piletid ({{len .Tickets}}){{else}}Pilet{{end}}</div>
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;border-collapse:collapse;">
    {{range .Tickets}}<tr><td style="padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eceff1;color:#22333D;">Nr {{.Number}}{{with .Tier}} · {{.}}{{end}}{{with .Seat}} · {{.}}{{end}}{{with .DownloadURL}}<br><a href="{{.}}" style="color:{{$.Accent}};font-size:13px;">Laadi PDF alla</a>{{end}}</td>{{with .Price}}<td style="padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eceff1;color:#22333D;white-space:nowrap;text-align:right;">{{.}}</td>{{end}}</tr>
    {{else}}<tr><td style="padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eceff1;color:#22333D;">Nr {{.TicketID}}{{with .TierName}} · {{.}}{{end}}{{with .SeatSector}} · Sektor {{.}}{{end}}{{with .SeatRow}} · Rida {{.}}{{end}}{{with .SeatNumber}} · Koht {{.}}{{end}}</td></tr>
    {{end}}</table>
  </td></tr>
  {{with .Payment}}<tr><td style="padding:8px 32px;">
    <div style="font-size:12px;color:#93a0a8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;padding-bottom:4px;">Makse</div>
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;border-collapse:collapse;">
      <tr><td style="padding:4px 0;color:#46555f;">Tellimus</td><td style="padding:4px 0;color:#22333D;white-space:nowrap;text-align:right;">Nr {{.OrderNumber}}</td></tr>
      {{with .PaidAt}}<tr><td style="padding:4px 0;color:#46555f;">Makstud</td><td style="padding:4px 0;color:#22333D;white-space:nowrap;text-align:right;">{{.}}</td></tr>{{end}}
      {{with .Subtotal}}<tr><td style="padding:4px 0;color:#46555f;">Piletid</td><td style="padding:4px 0;color:#22333D;white-space:nowrap;text-align:right;">{{.}}</td></tr>{{end}}
      {{with .Discount}}<tr><td style="padding:4px 0;color:#46555f;">Allahindlus</td><td style="padding:4px 0;color:#22333D;white-space:nowrap;text-align:right;">−{{.}}</td></tr>{{end}}
      {{with .ServiceFee}}<tr><td style="padding:4px 0;color:#46555f;">Teenustasu</td><td style="padding:4px 0;color:#22333D;white-space:nowrap;text-align:right;">{{.}}</td></tr>{{end}}
      <tr><td style="padding:8px 0 4px 0;border-top:1px solid #dfe3e6;color:#22333D;font-weight:bold;">Kokku makstud</td><td style="padding:8px 0 4px 0;border-top:1px solid #dfe3e6;color:#22333D;font-weight:bold;white-space:nowrap;text-align:right;">{{.Total}}</td></tr>
    </table>
  </td></tr>{{end}}
  {{with .EventNote.HTML}}<tr><td style="padding:8px 32px;">
    <div style="font-size:12px;color:#93a0a8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;padding-bottom:4px;">Ürituse kohta</div>
    <div style="color:#46555f;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">{{.}}</div>
  </td></tr>{{end}}
  {{if .WithdrawalNotice}}<tr><td style="padding:8px 32px;color:#46555f;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">Kindlal kuupäeval toimuva ürituse piletitele ei kehti taganemisõigus. Teie tellimus muutus siduvaks makse tegemise hetkel.</td></tr>{{end}}
  <tr><td style="padding:8px 32px;color:#46555f;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">Avage fail telefonis ja näidake sissepääsu juures vöötkoodi — printida pole vaja.</td></tr>
  {{template "contact_html" .}}<tr><td style="padding:16px 32px 28px 32px;color:#93a0a8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;border-top:1px solid #eceff1;">
    Saadetud aadressile: {{.RecipientEmail}}<br><br>
{{with .Branding.WebsiteURL}}<a href="{{.}}" style="color:#93a0a8;">{{.}}</a><br><br>{{end}}
  <p style="font-size:11px;color:#666;line-height:1.5">
    {{.Branding.SellerLabel}} <strong>{{.Branding.LegalName}}</strong>
    {{with .Branding.LegalAddressLine1}}<br>{{.}}{{end}}
    {{with .Branding.LegalAddressLine2}}<br>{{.}}{{end}}
    {{with .Branding.LegalAddressPostalCode}}<br>{{.}}{{with $.Branding.LegalAddressCity}} {{.}}{{end}}{{else}}{{with .Branding.LegalAddressCity}}<br>{{.}}{{end}}{{end}}
    {{with .Branding.LegalAddressCountry}}<br>{{.}}{{end}}
    {{with .Branding.SellerIDs}}<br>{{.}}{{end}}{{with .Branding.PaymentLine}}<br>{{.}}{{end}}
    {{with .Branding.ContactEmail}}<br>Kontakt: <a href="mailto:{{.}}" style="color:#666">{{.}}</a>{{end}}{{if not .Branding.ContactEmail}}{{with .Branding.ContactFormURL}}<br>Kontakt: <a href="{{.}}" style="color:#666">Kirjutage korraldajale</a>{{end}}{{end}}
  </p>
  <p style="font-size:11px;color:#999">{{if not .WhiteLabel}}<a href="https://arenasoldout.com" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline">Piletite töötlemine: arenasoldout.com</a>{{end}}</p>
  <p style="font-size:11px;color:#999;line-height:1.5">Kui vajutate „Tellimus lõpetada“, ei jõua teieni enam piletitega kirjad ega olulised kirjad teie tellimuse kohta. Turundusuudiskirju me ilma teie nõusolekuta ei saada.</p>
  </td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>{{end}}

